Evaluation fixture notice

The current single_label.json contains twelve original, fictional sentences
written for threat-bot regression tests. It replaces the full TRAM excerpt
dataset. multi_label.json has been removed. fixtures.json contains manually
authored extractor responses, and baseline.json defines the synthetic replay
expectation. These are not recorded live-model results or an accuracy benchmark.
The new original fixtures follow the repository LICENSE.

Earlier snapshots included the TRAM (Threat Report ATT&CK Mapper) dataset from
the Center for Threat-Informed Defense:
